Responsible (R): Merchandising / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): Product Safety &amp; Compliance Manager
Duration: Per recall</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2996_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2996_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
