      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Recall execution underway
Frequency: Per recall event
Volume: ~3–8 plans/year
Owner: Product Safety &amp; Compliance Manager
Participants: Product Safety Mgr, Quality, Data Analytics, Store Ops
Source: workflow W2999 — Recall Effectiveness Check Planning &amp; Sample Design</bpmn:documentation>
