Responsible (R): Product Safety &amp; Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): Regulatory Compliance Manager
Duration: Per recall</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2999_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2999_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
